      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so something weird just happened like an hour ago. my vision in my left eye got all blurry and kind of dark for like a couple mins but it went away. also my right hand felt super clumsy and awkward for a bit. i feel totally fine now though so i was just wondering if i should be worried or if i should just keep an eye on it?",
